# Environment — Money Autopilot / Hermes

Copy to `.env` in project root (or set in Hostinger / n8n).

```bash
# Public URL of Money Autopilot server (required for calendar links + n8n)
APP_BASE_URL=https://autopilot.moneymagnettools.com

# Public URL of Money Magnet Tools static hub (checkout success + landing)
TOOLS_BASE_URL=https://tools.moneymagnettools.com

# Stripe — Money Autopilot Engine checkout ($197)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
# Optional: use Stripe Dashboard price instead of inline price_data
# STRIPE_PRICE_ID_ENGINE=price_...

# Outreach automation — n8n or Zapier webhook (welcome + sale emails)
OUTREACH_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-n8n.app/webhook/outreach-events
OUTREACH_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-long-random-secret

# Optional: require n8n / external webhooks to send this header
HERMES_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-long-random-secret

# 33333 Autopilot Revenue (consumer lane)
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=
GOOGLE_DRIVE_VAULT_FOLDER=
LEAD_MAGNET_BASE_URL=https://autopilot.moneymagnettools.com/33333
FOUNDER_EMAIL=you@example.com
N33333_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-33333-n8n-secret

# Stripe Payment Links — 33333 consumer products (paste from Stripe Dashboard)
STRIPE_LINK_VV_BEAT_PACK=https://buy.stripe.com/your-link
STRIPE_LINK_VV_TEMPLATES=
STRIPE_LINK_VV_COURSE=
STRIPE_LINK_AS_DAILY=
STRIPE_LINK_AS_GUIDEBOOK=
STRIPE_LINK_AS_BIRTH_CHART=
STRIPE_LINK_MM_JOURNAL=
STRIPE_LINK_MM_CHALLENGE=
STRIPE_LINK_MM_APP=
STRIPE_LINK_RS_SCAN=
STRIPE_LINK_RS_UNLIMITED=
STRIPE_LINK_RS_AGENCY=
STRIPE_LINK_33_PRACTICE=
STRIPE_LINK_33_FORGE=
STRIPE_LINK_33_CROWN=

# ConvertKit — welcome sequences + abandoned cart
CONVERTKIT_API_KEY=
CONVERTKIT_FORM_VAULTVERSE=
CONVERTKIT_FORM_AURASCRIPT=
CONVERTKIT_FORM_MIRRORME=
CONVERTKIT_FORM_RESUME=
CONVERTKIT_FORM_33333=
CONVERTKIT_TAG_ABANDONED_CART=
# Optional brand tags (comma-separated IDs)
CONVERTKIT_TAG_VAULTVERSE=
CONVERTKIT_TAG_AURASCRIPT=
CONVERTKIT_TAG_MIRRORME=
CONVERTKIT_TAG_RESUME=
CONVERTKIT_TAG_33333=

# Calendar timezone — match primary Google Calendar
APPROVAL_REMINDER_TZ=America/New_York

# Notion (existing SGOS)
NOTION_APPROVAL_QUEUE_URL=https://notion.so/...
NOTION_MASTER_MAP_URL=https://notion.so/...
NOTION_HERMES_STATUS_URL=https://notion.so/...
```

## n8n environment

In n8n → Settings → Variables (or workflow env):

| Variable | Value |
|----------|--------|
| `APP_BASE_URL` | Same as above |
| `TOOLS_BASE_URL` | Tools hub URL |
| `HERMES_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | Same as server (if set) |
| `FOUNDER_EMAIL` | Sale notification inbox |

Import workflows:
- **`docs/n8n/sgos-hermes-calendar.workflow.json`** — SGOS/Hermes calendar (governance lane)
- **`docs/n8n/33333-autopilot-revenue-engine.workflow.json`** — 33333 consumer autopilot
- **`docs/n8n/outreach-welcome-sale.workflow.json`** — Engine welcome + sale emails
- **`docs/n8n/sovereign-loop.workflow.json`** — Sovereign B2B sales loop (Solar)

## Revenue lanes (do not mix)

| Lane | Scope | Checkout |
|------|-------|----------|
| **33333** | First brain consumer (VaultVerse, AuraScript, etc.) | `STRIPE_LINK_*` Payment Links → `/33333` |
| **Outreach** | Money Autopilot Engine ($197) | `/api/checkout/engine` → tools hub landing |
| **Sovereign** | B2B Solar AI Agent ($15K+) | `/api/sovereign/*` |
| **Hermes/SGOS** | Governance, approval gates | Not consumer checkout |

See **`docs/33333/33333_QUICK_START_GUIDE.md`** for 33333 launch plan.
